#42000
morvane dark twin lich gemmar~
Morvane of House Gemmar~
Morvane, the Dark Twin, sits upon a throne of black stone, smiling.
~
Once he was a handsome young man, and something of that remains: the
fine bones of his face, the easy smile, the long elegant hands.  The
rest has withered away to parchment skin stretched over bone, and his
eyes burn with a cold green fire.  Black roots run from the throne into
his back and shoulders, and every few moments they pulse, and a far-off
moan drifts down from the forest above.  He and his sister were born
beneath one star; he swore that he would never die, and he has kept his
word at the cost of everyone around him.
~
