#42001
fiend skeleton cloaked~
the Fiend~
Before you stands the Fiend, beckoning you to approach.
~
The Fiend is a ghastly sight.  It appears to be a skeleton with a
sinister, hellishly grinning skull, wrapped in the dark cloak that hid
it as it led you through the woods.  Only its eyes appear human, and
nothing human lurks behind them.  It is Morvane's huntsman, and it
brings the souls that feed the trees.
~
