#42002
tree soul weeping twisted~
a weeping soul-tree~
A pale, twisted tree bends toward you, a face of agony in its bark.
~
The tree is pale and leafless, its bark gathered into the unmistakable
face of a man or woman, mouth open in a silent scream.  Its branches
reach toward you, and sap runs from its eyes like tears.  Whoever it
was, it is not entirely gone; and what is left of it is not friendly.
~
