ghoul~
a ghoul~
A hunched ghoul gnaws on something it has dug up.
~
The ghoul was a man once, or something like one.  Now it is gray,
hairless and gaunt, with long cracked nails and a mouth full of yellow
teeth, and it smells of the grave.  It looks up from its meal with flat,
hungry eyes.
~
