wight barrow~
a barrow wight~
A barrow wight stalks among the tombs, its eyes like cold stars.
~
The wight is a tall, gaunt figure in the rotted finery of a lord of
House Gemmar, a circlet of tarnished silver on its brow.  Its flesh is
gray and dry, and its eyes are two points of cold, pale light.  The air
around it is bitterly cold.
~
