light pale spirit aurelle~
a pale, radiant light~
A pale, radiant light hovers above the crypt, almost taking the shape of a young woman.
~
The light is soft and golden, warm in this cold place, and as you watch
it it gathers itself into the shape of a young woman with a sad, gentle
face.  The shape never quite holds; it wavers and fades and gathers
itself again, like a candle flame in a draft.
~
