worm grave corpse-fed~
a corpse-fed grave worm~
A pale grave worm, thick as a man's thigh, writhes out of the earth.
~
It is a worm, but one as long as a horse and as thick as a man's thigh,
pale and glistening, with a round mouth ringed by tiny hooked teeth.  It
has grown fat on the dead of House Gemmar, and it is not particular
about whether its meals are dead yet.
~
