bone sentinel guardian~
a bone sentinel~
A towering sentinel of fused bones stands guard here, motionless.
~
Built from the bones of many bodies fused into one huge frame, the
sentinel stands half again as tall as a man, with four arms and a skull
for a head that turns, slowly, to follow you.  It does not breathe, and
it does not blink.
~
