#42010
hobb gravedigger old man~
old Hobb the gravedigger~
Old Hobb the gravedigger sits on his cot, sharpening a shovel and talking to himself.
~
Hobb is ancient, bent nearly double, with a fringe of white hair and a
face like a dried apple.  He has dug graves here for longer than he can
remember, for a family long dead and for the strangers the Fiend brings,
and somewhere along the way he stopped being entirely sane.  He talks to
himself constantly, and to his shovel, and occasionally to you.
~
